    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d241-a1">

                <pb facs="0474" n="460" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg460"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Combined Chiefs of Staff</hi><anchor
                        n="80" xml:id="d241-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-08">8 September,
                        1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In the absence of agreed instructions from the European Advisory Commission, the
                    Combined Chiefs of Staff have forwarded the enclosed directive to the Supreme
                    Allied Commander, Mediterranean, for purposes of planning for military
                    government in Austria. The Supreme Commander, Allied Expeditionary Force,<anchor
                        n="81" xml:id="d241-f2"/> has been furnished a copy of this directive.</p>
                <p>The Combined Chiefs of Staff request that a copy of this directive be transmitted
                    to the European Advisory Commission for information.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">For the Combined Chiefs of Staff: <table>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#nowrap">A. T. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                    >Cornwall-Jones</hi>,<lb/>  <hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >Brigadier</hi>
                            </cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell rendition="#nowrap">A. J. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                    >McFarland</hi>
                                <lb/>   <hi rendition="#italic">Brigadier General, U.S.A.</hi>
                            </cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Combined Secretariat</hi>
                            </cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                    </table>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d241-f1" n="80" type="source" xml:id="d241-f1-content">
                <p>Addressed to the Department of State and the British Embassy.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d241-f2" n="81" xml:id="d241-f2-content">
                <p>Gen. Dwight D. Eisenhower.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
